  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 - Initial release\n      - Cron-based scheduling with standard cron expressions\n      - DAG task chains (parent-child relationships with OnSuccess/OnFailure/Always rules)\n      - Redis distributed locks with watchdog auto-renewal\n      - Hangfire-style Enqueue and RecurringJob API\n      - Multi-database support (SQL Server / MySQL / PostgreSQL / SQLite)\n      - Embedded dashboard for task management\n      - RESTful API for CRUD + Pause/Resume/Trigger/Replay\n      - Snowflake ID generation\n      - Auto table creation on startup",
